"""Russian (Русский) templates for `taslation.messages` (see `taslation.message_texts`): вы, as the window; its
buttons as the window names them (Стоп).

Russian has several plural forms: a count is written as a label ("пузырей: 5", "страниц: 21") or with a word that
does not change ("{minutes} мин"), so that it reads right for every number.

Machine-translated; no native review.
"""

